== Description ==

'''Medical Gauze''' is a medical consumable in ''[[Human Host]]'', sourced from the world (loot, salvage, or base crafting). It appears as an ingredient in 3 downstream recipes at the [[Biochemical Workbench]], including [[Medkit]], [[Medical Case]], [[Medical Bandage]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

